@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName IPAGothic
title AT 変速判定 / 車速とスロットル開度から推奨ギアが決まる [13] speed=90, throttle=50, gear=4
legend left
  ECUが初期化されている
endlegend
analog "車速 [km/h]" between 0 and 90 as s0
analog "スロットル開度 [%]" between 0 and 50 as s1
analog "推奨ギア (期待) [速]" between 0 and 4 as s2

@0
s0 is 90
s1 is 50
@10
s0 is 90
s1 is 50
s2 is 4
highlight 10 to 20 #Gold;line:DimGrey : 確認
@enduml
